OL,4,BInjured Jacks out of T20 Australia tour
OL,5,GEngland all-rounder Will Jacks has     
OL,6,Gbeen ruled out of the rest of the tour 
OL,7,Gof Australia with a broken hand.       
OL,9,FThe 28-year-old was injured after four 
OL,10,Fballs of the penultimate over as       
OL,11,FAustralia took victory in the first    
OL,12,FT20 international in Melbourne on      
OL,13,FSaturday.                              
OL,15,FJacks was hurt trying to take a caught-
OL,16,Fand-bowled chance off Ben Dwarshuis.   
OL,18,FThe injury means versatile Tom Banton  
OL,19,Fwill skipper the side for the fifth    
OL,20,Fand final T20 in Canberra on 2         
OL,21,FDecember.                              
OL,22,D]C                Fixtures 357/358/359 
